title: "Apple Health Data Pipeline: export to a bronze/silver/gold lakehouse, Lakeview dashboard, Streamlit app and PyTorch ML"
abstract: >-
  Turns an Apple Health export into a medallion lakehouse that runs locally on DuckDB or on
  Databricks from the same SQL files, with a Streamlit app and PyTorch ML experiments.
